ntain that reaches into the stratosphere.\n- No checkpoints will save you from falling.\n- Your skills will be tested, your limits broken.\n- Tunnelling available to alleviate motion sickness. (Vignette)\n- Option to swap hands on the hammer.\n- There is a reward for those who reach the top.\n\nI know it's quite a clamber up those rocks, but once you get to the top, the view is worth it.\n\nIt's not the mountain we conquer, but ourselves.", "short_description": "A punishing VR climbing game. Climb a surreal mountain with nothing but a hammer."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.opsoftworks.com/clamb-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "OP Softworks", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.opsoftworks.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8618858924850156"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 12, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1818383662805406"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1084225557384096"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1050260847831227"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1533459368408599"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1430414811945255"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "732986049533161"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "847371118007303"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1357399271903050"